Upstream Benchmark License & Attribution Notice
===============================================

1. International SAT Competition 2024, 2025, and 2026 Main Track Benchmark
   Manifests (`main_2024.uri`, `main_2025.uri`, `main_2026.uri`):

   The benchmark URI manifests reference the official Main Track benchmark
   corpora of the International SAT Competitions 2024, 2025, and 2026 hosted by
   the Global Benchmark Database (GBD):
     - SAT Competition 2024: https://satcompetition.github.io/2024/
     - SAT Competition 2025: https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/
     - SAT Competition 2026: https://satcompetition.github.io/2026/
     - Global Benchmark Database (GBD): https://benchmark-database.de/
     - GBD tooling (MIT License): https://github.com/Udopia/gbd

   International SAT Competition benchmark packages are distributed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0):
     https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

   All downloaded `.cnf.xz` instances remain subject to CC-BY-4.0 and the
   attribution terms of their original competition submitters.

